      "pinyin": "shuài gē ná chū zì jǐ de piào hěn méi yǒu lǐ mào de shuō kàn qīng chu zhè shì wǒ de zuò wèi",
      "english": "She looked at the ticket in her hand once more, and then said politely: \"Hello, I believe you are in the wrong seat?\""
    },
    {
