    "sentence_translations": [
      "Taking the Wrong Seat",
      "",
      "After the girl got on the train, she discovered that a handsome guy was sitting in her seat.",
      "She looked at the ticket in her hand once more, and then said politely: \"Hello, I believe you are in the wrong seat?\"",
      "The handsome guy took out his ticket, and said rudely: \"Take a good look! This is my seat.\"",
      "The girl looked carefully at his ticket, but did not say anything.",
      "Pleased with himself, the handsome guy said:",
      "\"Girls nowadays are really something. Flirting by copying others, can't even come up with new methods!\"",
      "The girl stood next to the handsome guy, and did not say a thing.",
      "A moment later the train started moving, and the girl faced the guy and said smiling: \"You're not in the wrong seat, you're just on the wrong train.\""
    ]
